{
  "name": "dsh-persona",
  "version": "1.4.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "身份与人设：DSH 设置里的「身份与人设」页，直接编辑 QQ 桥接的 personas.json。默认人格是「蓝色大肥鱼」（DeepSeek 鲸鱼娘二创）；模式支持三段式（是谁 / 什么时候开口 / 怎么说话）+ 备用风格随机换，老的一整段文字格式照样能用、可一键拆成三段；还能给一个角色名，自动从互联网学习人设和说话方式。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "templates/*.json",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "persona",
    "qq-bridge"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
